From 35b7561aec427b04f6723287bdd8cd3b50228e94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fridrich Strba <fridrich.strba@bluewin.ch>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:20:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Stop opening JDK packages that no longer exist or are not
 used

Drop Java 8 era nashorn, rt.jar and jfxrt.jar paths from the launchers
---
 .../adoptopenjdk/icedteaweb/jvm/JvmUtils.java |  4 ---
 .../icedteaweb/jvm/JvmUtilsTest.java          |  2 +-
 launchers/itw-modularjdk.args                 |  5 ----
 launchers/rust-launcher/src/jars_helper.rs    | 29 ++++---------------
 launchers/rust-launcher/src/main.rs           |  4 +--
 launchers/shell-launcher/launchers.bat.in     |  9 ++----
 launchers/shell-launcher/launchers.sh.in      | 11 ++-----
 7 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 50 deletions(-)

